{"chapter":{"blocks":[{"text":"第11章 优化算法","type":"TITLE"},{"text":"本节学习：第11章 优化算法。讲义保留原有示例与练习，可结合正文向教师提问。","type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"text":"- **SGD**：随机梯度下降，每次一个小批量。\n- **动量法**：积累历史梯度，冲过局部坑。\n- **AdaGrad/RMSProp**：自适应学习率。\n- **Adam**：动量 + RMSProp，最常用。\n- **学习率调度**：训练中途调小学习率。\n\n---","type":"MARKDOWN"}],"grade_max":12,"grade_min":10,"knowledge_points":[{"description":"学习并解释「第11章 优化算法」中的核心概念与示例。","name":"第11章 优化算法","slug":"senior-deep-learning-topic-11","topic":"计算机与人工智能"}],"license_code":"UNKNOWN","objectives":["解释「第11章 优化算法」的主要概念，并结合示例完成文中练习。"],"order_index":22,"revision":1,"slug":"ch-011-main","source":{"conversion":"supplied-markdown-v1","original_sha256":"060459597f7d47343ad7b47c43e2f7c165bbe51aaaf981165b34d373d765b74f","source_commit":null,"source_path":"sources/060459597f7d4734/03-动手学深度学习.md"},"stage":"SENIOR","title":"第11章 优化算法"},"content_hash":"c8acc1d6cf526ffcaf04f718e5d6a5d6783ac5488d549de088ec5e826acc4fb9","course":{"slug":"senior-deep-learning","title":"动手学深度学习","topic":"计算机与人工智能"},"is_test_fixture":false,"manifest_hash":"b2500e5121455aa9339fe6399902e89a0917eaf9bd814708a6dc69af397b6b20","release_key":"computing-ai-md-v1-db6ffb6b663b","schema_version":"k12.content.revision-snapshot.v1","source_kind":"NEW_SOURCE"}
